# List Style (No Bullet Characters)

Never use Unicode bullet characters (`•`, `●`, `◦`, etc.) in agent output.

Always write lists as Markdown: a hyphen/dash, then a space, then the item text (`- `).

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
• First item
• Second item

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
- First item
- Second item
```
